    intro: "<div class=\"cat-intro\">\n          <h4><span data-lang-el=\"bn\">💡 চাইনিজে Tense কীভাবে কাজ করে?</span><span data-lang-el=\"en\">💡 How does tense work in Chinese?</span></h4>\n          <p><span data-lang-el=\"bn\">Chinese-এ verb-এর কোনো রূপ পরিবর্তন হয় না — \"去\" মানে go/went/going সবকিছুই। Auxiliary verb আর Time Word একসাথে মিলে Past/Present/Future বোঝায়।</span><span data-lang-el=\"en\">Chinese verbs never change form — \"去\" means go/went/going all at once. Auxiliary verbs combine with time words to express Past/Present/Future.</span></p>\n          <div class=\"tense-row\">\n            <div class=\"tense-label\">🕒 <span data-lang-el=\"bn\">বর্তমান (Present)</span><span data-lang-el=\"en\">Present</span></div>\n            <div class=\"word-list\">现在 (xiànzài) <span data-lang-el=\"bn\">এখন</span><span data-lang-el=\"en\">now</span> · 今天 (jīntiān) <span data-lang-el=\"bn\">আজ</span><span data-lang-el=\"en\">today</span></div>\n            <div class=\"ex-line\">→ 我现在能说中文。 (Wǒ xiànzài néng shuō Zhōngwén.) <span data-lang-el=\"bn\">আমি এখন চাইনিজ বলতে পারি।</span><span data-lang-el=\"en\">I can speak Chinese now.</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"tense-row\">\n            <div class=\"tense-label\">🕒 <span data-lang-el=\"bn\">অতীত (Past)</span><span data-lang-el=\"en\">Past</span></div>\n            <div class=\"word-list\">昨天 (zuótiān) <span data-lang-el=\"bn\">গতকাল</span><span data-lang-el=\"en\">yesterday</span> · 以前 (yǐqián) <span data-lang-el=\"bn\">আগে</span><span data-lang-el=\"en\">before</span> · 刚才 (gāngcái) <span data-lang-el=\"bn\">একটু আগে</span><span data-lang-el=\"en\">just now</span></div>\n            <div class=\"ex-line\">→ 我以前是学生。 (Wǒ yǐqián shì xuésheng.) <span data-lang-el=\"bn\">আমি আগে ছাত্র ছিলাম।</span><span data-lang-el=\"en\">I used to be a student.</span></div>\n            <div class=\"ex-line\">→ 我有过这种经验。 (Wǒ yǒuguò zhè zhǒng jīngyàn.) <span data-lang-el=\"bn\">আমার এই ধরনের অভিজ্ঞতা আগে ছিল।</span><span data-lang-el=\"en\">I have had this kind of experience before.</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"tense-row\">\n            <div class=\"tense-label\">🕒 <span data-lang-el=\"bn\">ভবিষ্যৎ (Future)</span><span data-lang-el=\"en\">Future</span></div>\n            <div class=\"word-list\">明天 (míngtiān) <span data-lang-el=\"bn\">আগামীকাল</span><span data-lang-el=\"en\">tomorrow</span> · 以后 (yǐhòu) <span data-lang-el=\"bn\">পরে</span><span data-lang-el=\"en\">later</span> · 马上 (mǎshàng) <span data-lang-el=\"bn\">এখনই</span><span data-lang-el=\"en\">right away</span></div>\n            <div class=\"ex-line\">→ 我明天会去。 (Wǒ míngtiān huì qù.) <span data-lang-el=\"bn\">আমি আগামীকাল যাব।</span><span data-lang-el=\"en\">I will go tomorrow.</span></div>\n            <div class=\"ex-line\">→ 我要去中国。 (Wǒ yào qù Zhōngguó.) <span data-lang-el=\"bn\">আমি চীনে যাচ্ছি (পরিকল্পিত)।</span><span data-lang-el=\"en\">I'm going to China (planned).</span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"warn-note\">⚠️ <span data-lang-el=\"bn\">মনে রাখবেন: 会 দুই অর্থে ব্যবহার হয় — শেখা দক্ষতা (我会说中文) এবং ভবিষ্যৎ (明天会下雨)। Context থেকে অর্থ বোঝা যায়।</span><span data-lang-el=\"en\">Remember: 会 has two meanings — a learned skill (我会说中文) and future action (明天会下雨). Context tells them apart.</span></div>\n        </div>",
